Oliva Mapping Hand Function Imaging Neuroscience 2025


Data includes:

- Anatomical brain-extracted T1w image
- Functional brain data for Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks
- Anatomical defaced T2w spinal cord image
- Functional spinal cord data for Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks

	In derivatives/labels:	
	- Anatomical T2w spinal cord image registered to PAM50 template
	- Segmentation of spinal cord functional images (Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks)

	In derivatives/physio:
	- Raw and processed physio files (cardiac pulse and respiration)


Note: 

- The following subjects completed the tasks in two separate days due to technical issues: sub-NSPilot006, sub-NSPilot014
- Task regressors are shared in GitHub at the following link: https://github.com/NeuromuscularInsightLab/Oliva_Mapping_Hand_Functon_Imaging_Neuroscience_2025/tree/main/trialwise_analysis
